{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu07", "cards": [{"id": "u4.t.photosynthesis", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">pho<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">to<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">SYN<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">the<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">sis<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"photosynthesis\" data-audio=\"audio/photosynthesis.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: photosynthesis\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"photosynthesis\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Light +<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">CO2 +<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">water<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"62.625\" font-size=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Chloroplast<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Sugar +<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">oxygen<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The process that uses light energy to make sugar from carbon dioxide and water.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>光合作用<\/b>：利用光能把二氧化碳和水制成糖的过程。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">photo = light, synthesis = put together.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">photo = 光，synthesis = 合成。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which gas is released by photosynthesis?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Oxygen.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.chlorophyll", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">CHLO<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ro<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">phyll<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"chlorophyll\" data-audio=\"audio/chlorophyll.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: chlorophyll\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"chlorophyll\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"30\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"35\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">green<\/text><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"85\" y2=\"50\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"85.0\" y1=\"50.0\" x2=\"110.0\" y2=\"50.0\"/><polygon points=\"110.0,50.0 105.5,52.2 105.5,47.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"115\" y=\"30\" width=\"70\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f6\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">light captured<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">chlorophyll absorbs red and blue light<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The green pigment that captures light energy for photosynthesis.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>叶绿素<\/b>：捕获光能用于光合作用的绿色色素。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">chloro = green, phyll = leaf. Green leaf stuff.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">chloro = 绿，phyll = 叶。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What colour is chlorophyll?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Green.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.endosymbiotic-theory", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">en<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">do<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">sym<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">bi<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">OT<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ic<\/span> <span class=\"st\">THE<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ry<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"endosymbiotic theory\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: endosymbiotic theory\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"endosymbiotic theory\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Large cell<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"58.2\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">engulfs a<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"67.4\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">small<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"76.6\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">prokaryote<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"53.6\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Prokaryote<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"62.8\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">lives on<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">inside<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"47.85\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">It<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"58.05\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">becomes<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"68.25\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">an<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"78.45\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">organelle<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The idea that mitochondria and chloroplasts began as free-living prokaryotes that were taken in by a larger cell.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>内共生学说<\/b>：线粒体和叶绿体起初是独立生活的原核生物，后来被较大的细胞吞入并留在细胞内。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">endo = inside, sym = together, bio = life. Living together inside.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">endo = 内，sym = 共同，bio = 生活。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Name an organelle thought to come from an engulfed prokaryote.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">The mitochondrion or the chloroplast.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.pseudopod", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">PSEU<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">do<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">pod<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"pseudopod\" data-audio=\"audio/pseudopod.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: pseudopod\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-pseudopod.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" alt=\"Amoeba proteus under a microscope. The bulges at its edges are pseudopods (&quot;false feet&quot;).\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Amoeba proteus under a microscope. The bulges at its edges are pseudopods (&quot;false feet&quot;).<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">显微镜下的大变形虫。边缘鼓出的部分就是伪足。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: SmallRex · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Amoeba_proteus_another_form.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"pseudopod\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M70 60 Q60 35 85 38 Q95 20 110 35 Q135 30 130 55 Q150 65 125 78 Q120 98 100 88 Q80 100 75 80 Q50 85 70 60 Z\" class=\"f3 k\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"58\" r=\"9\" class=\"f4\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"7.142857142857142\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">pseudopod<\/text><line x1=\"158.0\" y1=\"42.0\" x2=\"128.0\" y2=\"50.0\"/><polygon points=\"128.0,50.0 131.8,46.7 132.9,50.9\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">false foot<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A temporary bulge of cytoplasm that an amoeba uses to move and to engulf food.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>伪足<\/b>：变形虫用来移动和包住食物的细胞质临时突起。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">pseudo = false, pod = foot. False foot.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">pseudo = 假，pod = 足。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What is a pseudopod used for?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Moving and engulfing food.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.amoeba", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">a<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">MOE<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ba<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"amoeba\" data-audio=\"audio/amoeba.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: amoeba\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-amoeba.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"614\" alt=\"Amoeba proteus under a microscope, stretching out many pseudopods. It is about half a millimetre long.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Amoeba proteus under a microscope, stretching out many pseudopods. It is about half a millimetre long.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">显微镜下的大变形虫，伸出很多伪足。它长约半毫米。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: SmallRex · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Amoeba_proteus_with_many_pseudopodia.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"amoeba\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M70 60 Q60 35 85 38 Q95 20 110 35 Q135 30 130 55 Q150 65 125 78 Q120 98 100 88 Q80 100 75 80 Q50 85 70 60 Z\" class=\"f3 k\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"58\" r=\"9\" class=\"f4\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">constantly changing shape<\/text><text x=\"40\" y=\"15\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">nucleus<\/text><line x1=\"70.0\" y1=\"18.0\" x2=\"96.0\" y2=\"52.0\"/><polygon points=\"96.0,52.0 91.5,49.7 95.0,47.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A single-celled protist with no fixed shape that moves and feeds using pseudopods.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>变形虫<\/b>：没有固定形状的单细胞原生生物，用伪足移动和摄食。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">amoeba = Greek for change.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">amoeba 在希腊语里是「变化」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: How does an amoeba move?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">With pseudopods.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.cilia", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">CIL<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">i<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">a<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"cilia\" data-audio=\"audio/cilia.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: cilia\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-cilia.webp\" width=\"505\" height=\"800\" alt=\"Tetrahymena, a ciliate, under a fluorescence microscope. The fine lines along its body are rows of cilia.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Tetrahymena, a ciliate, under a fluorescence microscope. The fine lines along its body are rows of cilia.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">荧光显微镜下的四膜虫（一种纤毛虫）。身上细细的线是一排排纤毛。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: see source · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.5\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY 2.5<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tetrahymena_thermophila.png\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"cilia\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"62\" ry=\"24\" class=\"f1 k\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"52\" y2=\"33\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"72\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"29\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"28\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"28\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"29\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"145\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"33\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"52\" y2=\"87\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"72\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"91\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"92\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"92\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"91\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"145\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"87\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">cilia beat like tiny oars<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Short, hair-like projections that beat together to move a cell or sweep food. Singular: cilium.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>纤毛<\/b>：短短的毛状突起，一起摆动来推动细胞或扫入食物。单数 cilium。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">cilia = eyelashes.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">cilia 意为「睫毛」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which protist moves with cilia?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Paramecium.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.paramecium", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">par<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">a<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">ME<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ci<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">um<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"paramecium\" data-audio=\"audio/paramecium.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: paramecium\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-paramecium.webp\" width=\"751\" height=\"689\" alt=\"A paramecium under a microscope. It is about 0.2 millimetres long and covered in tiny cilia.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A paramecium under a microscope. It is about 0.2 millimetres long and covered in tiny cilia.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">显微镜下的草履虫。它长约 0.2 毫米，全身长满细小的纤毛。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Barfooz at the English Wikipedia. · <a href=\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 3.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Paramecium.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"paramecium\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"62\" ry=\"24\" class=\"f1 k\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"52\" y2=\"33\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"72\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"29\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"28\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"28\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"29\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"145\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"33\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"52\" y2=\"87\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"72\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"91\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"92\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"92\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"91\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"145\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"87\" class=\"\"/><path d=\"M70 58 Q100 72 130 58\" class=\"s\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">oral groove takes in food<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A slipper-shaped protist covered in cilia, that lives in fresh water.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>草履虫<\/b>：全身覆盖纤毛、形似拖鞋的淡水原生生物。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">paramecium = oblong.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">草履虫像一只拖鞋。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What covers the surface of a paramecium?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Cilia.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u4.t.photosynthesis", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The process that uses light energy to make sugar from carbon dioxide and water.”<\/i>", "opts": ["protozoan", "photosynthesis", "endosymbiotic theory", "chloroplast"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>photosynthesis<\/b>: The process tha