, "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Short, hair-like projections that beat together to move a cell or sweep food. Singular: cilium.”<\/i>", "opts": ["pseudopod", "dinoflagellate", "cilia", "protozoan"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>cilia<\/b>: Short, hair-like projections that beat together to move a cell or sweep food. Singular: cilium. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纤毛<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.paramecium", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A slipper-shaped protist covered in cilia, that lives in fresh water.”<\/i>", "opts": ["green algae", "slime mold", "paramecium", "amoeba"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>paramecium<\/b>: A slipper-shaped protist covered in cilia, that lives in fresh water. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">草履虫<\/span>", "whys": null}]}